    // We start with post_residual as the baseline. Smaller is better.

    // 2. Harmonic Class Logic: Reward placements that leave remainders 
    // that are multiples of common item sizes or "easy" fractions of C.
    // We penalize residuals that are small but "awkward" (e.g., 1-4).
    if post_residual > 0 && post_residual <= 5 {
